[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 41341.106, "timestamp": "11:29:01", "text": "太麻煩了。莫，說真的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41344.55, "timestamp": "11:29:04", "text": "如果我不是……如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41347.19, "timestamp": "11:29:07", "text": "不是……等等，等等，我真的可以做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41350.39, "timestamp": "11:29:10", "text": "。等等，為什麼我沒有這麼做？巴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41354.39, "timestamp": "11:29:14", "text": "好了，是時候下載「"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41357.586, "timestamp": "11:29:17", "text": "我的手錶是什麼」應用程式了。是的。你好，米沙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41382.95, "timestamp": "11:29:42", "text": "你好嗎？上次你來的時候，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41387.746, "timestamp": "11:29:47", "text": "記得好像是在那個……嗯，是哪個直播流來著"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41390.71, "timestamp": "11:29:50", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41393.106, "timestamp": "11:29:53", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41394.55, "timestamp": "11:29:54", "text": "等等，等等，等等。那條溪流叫什麼名字來著"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 41397.83, "timestamp": "11:29:57", "text": "？ 20日。"}]